tools/build_mod.bat, tools/build_mod.ps1, tools/build_mod_helpers.ps1,
tools/vtex_tool.bat, tools/vtex_tool.ps1
    From https://github.com/Predi-i/Deadlock-UI-Mods (Apache-2.0).
    Modified: build_mod.ps1 also hides the types and test folders from
    the mod picker.

.shared/hud_lookup.ts
    From https://github.com/Predi-i/Deadlock-UI-Mods tools/hud_lookup.js
    (Apache-2.0). Modified: ported to a TypeScript module that exports
    find() instead of setting $.ModHudLookup. Routes and lookup logic
    unchanged. Bundled into each mod's script by the build.

checkm8/panorama/layout/hud_damage_impact.xml
    Valve's native Deadlock layout, exported from the game files, with one
    added <include>.

The kill-detection and chat-sending technique in checkm8 is based on
Predi-i's Well-Played-On-Kill. The code is a new implementation.
